 "notes": "One profile for GTA III, Vice City and San Andreas DE. PC keys: Definitive Edition PC defaults (magicgameworld GTA III DE list: Shift sprint, Space jump, Ctrl stealth, Tab weapon/radio wheel, W/S drive, Space handbrake, Q/E look, H horn, R sub-mission, Z look behind). SA-only keys (T gang follow, Y/N answers, Ctrl nitro) are not in that list. Two layers: F switches on foot / vehicle, B fixes it. Modes: on foot, car, bicycle, aircraft. F switches on foot <-> car; B cycles foot -> car -> bike -> aircraft. Bicycle/aircraft PC keys are the original PC defaults (gtabase).",
 "tips": {
  "es": "Este perfil es para el esquema de control Clásico del juego (Opciones → Controles → Esquema de control: Clásico). Con el esquema Moderno usá el perfil automático.",
